    "text": "<math><munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mtext>n-butylamine </mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>primary amine</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/> <math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mtext>Diethylamine </mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>Secondary amine</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/> <math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>                 </mtext></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mtext>ethyldimethylamine </mtext><mo>(</mo><mtext>tertiary amine</mtext><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/>Primary amines have two hydrogen atoms available for hydrogen bond formation, while  <math><mn>2</mn><mo>°</mo></math>  amines have only one hydrogen atom for hydrogen bond formation.  <math><mn>3</mn><mo>°</mo></math>  amines do not have intermolecular association due to absence of hydrogen atom.<br/><br/>Thus, order of boiling point of isomeric amines is as follows<br/><br/> <math><mn>3</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>°</mo></math> <br/><br/>or  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> ."
